# GroupFinding
# G3Cv11
# v11
# 2025-10-08
# Trystan Lambert <trystan.lambert@uwa.edu.au>
#
# Galaxy groups for the G09, G12, G15, and G23 regions.
# Groups built using Nessie and new GAMA III photometry based on profound (gkInputCat)#
# See Lambert (2025) for more details.
#
PairID      1   -      meta.id;meta.main  Unique paid ID (Same as GroupID)                                         
SepProjAng  2   kpc/h  pos.distance       Physical projected separation between galaxy 1 and galaxy 2              
SepVel      3   km/s   phys.veloc         Velocity separation of galaxy 1 and galaxy 2                             
RAbar       4   deg    pos.eq.ra          RA of the r-band (petro) flux weighted centre-of-light of the pair       
Decbar      5   deg    pos.eq.dec         Dec of the r-band (petro) flux weighted centre-of-light of the pair      
Zbar        6   -      src.redshift       	Redshift of the r-band (petro) flux weighted centre-of-light of the pair
MagSum      7   mag    phot.mag           Total r-band (petro) apparent magnitude of the pair                      
UberID1     8   -      meta.id            UberID of galaxy 2 in G3CGal                                             
UberID2     9   -      meta.id            UberID of galaxy 2 in G3CGal                                             
GAMARegion  10  -      -                  The GAMA region the galaxy is in.                                        
